              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/ShareInboxPiece",
                "asCell": [
                  "cell"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "description": "What the profile is to point at for the write to happen. Left out, the\npointer is set whatever it holds. Present and `undefined`, it is set only\nwhile the profile points at no inbox. A link, it is set only while the\nprofile points at that inbox, by a comparison of links that reads only\nlink shape: a link to an inbox holding nothing is a link, and names it.\nAn event spelled `{ inbox, replacing: undefined }` is a conditional one."
